$ Cantilever MITC4+ plate tilted 60 degrees about X, with 6 in the GRID PS field and the root clamped with SPC 12345.
$ The drilling direction (0, -0.866, 0.5) is already removed by PS = 6, so R2 must not be AUTOSPC'd. The grid-level
$ AUTOSPC bug tested the full 3x3 rotational block, constrained R2 at 24 grids and gave a normal tip deflection of
$ 3.3E-5 instead of 0.19845.
ID VB,tilt 60
SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = tilt 60
ECHO = NONE
SPC = 1
LOAD = 1
DISP = ALL
